 \\
\hline
   if $x_i \in C_j$  & $s_j$ & $M(\Seg{c_js_j})$\\
	& $z_j$ & $c_j$\\ 
	&  & $w_j$\\ 

	& $\Seg{c_jg_j} \dashv \Seg{s_jg_{j+1}} $ & $\Seg{w_{j}\alpha_{j}} \dashv \Seg{c_{j}g_{j}}$ \\





   if $\neg x_i \in C_j$  & $s_j$ & $\Seg{\beta_{j-1}w_j}	\dashv \Seg{c_js_j}$ \\
	& $w_j \perp \Seg{s_jg_{j+1}}$ &$w_j$\\
	& $z_j$ &$z_j$\\
