if $x_i \in C_{j+1}$ &  $\Seg{s_{j+1}c_{j+1}}	\dashv \Seg{s_{j}g_{j+1}}$    & $\Seg{\beta_jw_{j+1}}	\dashv \Seg{c_{j+1}s_{j+1}}$\\
