if $\neg x_i \in C_{j+1}$ &  			$\Seg{s_{j+1}c_{j+1}}	\dashv \Seg{s_{j}g_{j+1}}$  & $M(\Seg{s_{j+1}c_{j+1}})$\\
 & $z_{j+1}$ & $c_{j+1}$ \\
