The generator now exists and passes the basic construction checks at all four presets. At the hard preset it presents 768 exact sites but the answer remains a four-entry rational matrix (about 20–25 tokens); the bounded rotation language has roughly 5.2 billion candidates. I’m running the full 200,000-sample guess test, the eight-seed adversary/reference panel, scaling, and relabelling/isometry checks next.
