+## Use
+
+```python
+from gen_1211_4559 import DIFFICULTY, make_instance, parse_answer, render, verify
+
+inst = make_instance(seed=7, **DIFFICULTY["hard"])
+statement = render(inst)
+candidate = parse_answer("<answer>[[3/5,-4/5],[4/5,3/5]]</answer>")
